{"schema":1,"id":"2password","title":"Can an agent use a key it never sees?","lang":"en","sources":["https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/src/discover.ts","https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/src/op.ts","https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/README.md","https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secret-references/","https://developer.1password.com/docs/service-accounts/use-with-1password-cli/"],"settings":[],"answer":"The agent handles only an op:// reference, and op puts the value into the app’s environment","checks":[{"question":"The agent searches for “cloud key”, hoping to find the API key. What does find return, and why?","answer":"Nothing. No title contains “key”, so nothing matches, and no title is spelled close enough to be suggested (the closest scores 0.500 against a cut-off of 0.6). find compares the query with titles only; it cannot know that Cloud API holds a key, and it makes 1 op call, the item list, without fetching any item."},{"question":"The app prints API_KEY to stdout, and the agent reads stdout. Does passing a reference prevent that disclosure?","answer":"No. The app receives the resolved key and can print it. References keep field values out of find’s output and the launch request; they do not sandbox the app or redact its output."},{"question":"The agent’s transcript, containing op://Personal/Cloud API/credential, is pasted into a team chat. What does the team learn, and can they read the key?","answer":"They learn names: a vault called Personal, an item titled Cloud API and a field called credential. Reading the value still needs an op session with access to that vault; the reference carries no permission. The names themselves can still be sensitive, since they say which vaults and items exist."}],"scenarios":[{"values":{},"name":"","duration":97.967,"paper":"#ffffff","steps":[{"step":"ask","title":"An agent must start an app without reading its key","line":"Predict: what could the agent pass along instead of the key?","caption":"The app needs API_KEY in its environment. Printing that value for the agent would also put it into the conversation, though the agent’s job is to choose the credential and start the app, not to read it. What can name the credential without exposing its value?","start":0,"end":17.267,"hold":0.567,"state":{"needs":"API_KEY","agentHasValue":false},"changed":{"needs":{"after":"API_KEY"},"agentHasValue":{"after":false}},"picture":"Agent. ?. Application. needs API_KEY. must not read. the value.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│     ┌──────────────────────┐       ┌─────────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────────┐\n│     │                      │       │                     │        │                     │\n│     │        Agent         ────────▶          ?          ─────────▶     Application     │\n│     └──────────────────────┘       └─────────────────────┘        └─────────────────────┘\n│\n│            must not read                                             needs API_KEY\n│\n│\n│              the value\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"},{"step":"reader-boundary","title":"Answer: hand over a reference, and let op swap in the value","line":"The agent passes op://Personal/Cloud API/credential; op gives its value to the app.","caption":"The agent handles only an op:// reference, and op puts the value into the app’s environment. The reference names a vault, item and field without containing the key. Authenticated op resolves that name when it starts the app. This keeps the value out of the launch request, but the app can still read or print its own environment.","start":17.267,"end":39.033,"hold":18,"state":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true},"changed":{"needs":{"before":"API_KEY"},"ref":{"after":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential"},"childHasValue":{"after":true}},"picture":"Agent. op CLI. Application. op:// reference. secret value. op://Personal/Cloud API/credential.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                        op:// reference                  secret value\n│\n│     ┌──────────────────────┐       ┌─────────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────────┐\n│     │                      │       │                     │        │                     │\n│     │        Agent         ────────▶       op CLI        ─────────▶     Application     │\n│     └──────────────────────┘       └─────────────────────┘        └─────────────────────┘\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                              op://Personal/Cloud API/credential\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"},{"step":"boundary","title":"To pick a key, the agent searches titles, never values","line":"Predict: it asks for “cloud api” and the typo “databse”. What comes back?","caption":"find chooses items by comparing the query with their titles, so it needs no field values to choose. Here “cloud api” and “databse” search 3 sample titles.","start":39.033,"end":49.167,"hold":44.267,"state":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true,"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}]},"changed":{"walks":{"after":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}]}},"picture":"Flowchart: 4 nodes, 3 links; Code, 4 lines. Travelled: Agent → 2password find; 2password find → op CLI; focused: 2: Cloud API API_CREDENTIAL Personal; 3: Cloud Login LOGIN Work; and 1 more.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌     ┌──────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐     ┌───────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│  ▌     │  ────── ─│─────│  ─────────────  │─────││  ─────── │─────│  ─────────────── │\n│  ▌     │          │     │                 │     ││          │     │                  │\n│  ▌     └──────────┘     └─────────────────┘     └───────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│\n│\n│\n│                        ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        │                                             │\n│                        │▌title         category        vault         │\n│                        │▌Cloud API     API_CREDENTIAL  Personal      │\n│                        │▌Cloud Login   LOGIN           Work          │\n│                        │▌                                            │\n│                        │▌Database      DATABASE        Work          │\n│                        └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│"},{"step":"match","title":"Answer: a match for “cloud api”, a suggestion for “databse”","line":"Cloud API contains every word of “cloud api”; Database is 1 edit from “databse”.","caption":"Cloud API contains every word of “cloud api”, so it matches. No title contains “databse”, so find compares spellings instead: “databse” is 1 edit from “database”, close enough that Database comes back as a suggestion. Both answers compare the query with titles; neither looks at a secret.","start":49.167,"end":66.8,"hold":51.267,"state":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true,"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]}},"changed":{"matches":{"after":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]}},"found":{"after":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]}}},"picture":"Flowchart: 4 nodes, 3 links; Code, 4 lines. Travelled: Agent → 2password find; 2password find → op CLI; focused: 2: Cloud API match not close; 3: Cloud Login no api not close; and 1 more. New in this step: Code, 4 lines.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌     ┌──────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐     ┌───────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│  ▌     │  ────── ─│─────│  ─────────────  │─────││  ─────── │─────│  ─────────────── │\n│  ▌     │          │     │                 │     ││          │     │                  │\n│  ▌     └──────────┘     └─────────────────┘     └───────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│\n│\n│\n│                    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    │                                                     │\n│                    ▌ title         cloud api       databse               │\n│                    ▌ Cloud API     match           not close             │\n│                    ▌ Cloud Login   no api          not close             │\n│                    ▌                                                     │\n│                    ▌ Database      no cloud, api   close: suggested      │\n│                    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│"},{"step":"references","title":"The item details stop at the wrapper; the agent gets references","line":"2 op calls; every sample value is searched for in the output.","caption":"find lists titles, then fetches Cloud API and Database in one item get, whose reply holds the field values. The wrapper drops those values while decoding the reply and prints only op:// references. Upstream documents one desktop approval for the command.","start":66.8,"end":82.2,"hold":70.867,"state":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true,"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"references","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#1"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"A","edge":"message:T->A#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]},"leaked":0},"changed":{"walks":{"before":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}],"after":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"references","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#1"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"A","edge":"message:T->A#0"}]},"leaked":{"after":0}},"picture":"Sequence diagram: 3 participants, 6 messages. Note: “2 calls, 1 approval” beside op CLI; “secret values: none” beside 2password → Agent: op:// references; marked: 2password → Agent: op:// references. New in this step: 2password; Agent → 2password: find with two queries; 2password → op CLI: item list; and 3 more.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│                      ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      │                                                 │\n│                      │  ┌─────────┐     ┌───────────┐     ┌─────────┐  │\n│                      │  │  ────── │     │ ───────── │     │ ──────2 calls, 1 approval\n│                      │  └─────────┘     └───────────┘     └─────────┘  │\n│                      │       ││ ───────────── ││          └─────────┘  │\n│                      │       ──────────────────│              │││      │\n│                      │       ││               ││    ──────    │││      │\n│                      │       ││               ──────────────────│      │\n│                      │       ││               ││              │││      │\n│                      │       ││               ──────────────────│      │\n│                      │       ││               ──────────────────│      │\n│                      │       ││               ││ ──────────── │││      │\n│                      │       ││               ──────────────────│      │\n│                      │       ││               ││   ──   ──    │││      │\n│                      │       ││               ──────────────────│      │\n│                      │       ││               ││              │││      │\n│                      │       ││  ───────────  ││              │││      │\n│                      │       ──┌─────────────┐─│              │││      │\n│                      │       secret values: none              │││      │\n│                      │       └┘└─────────────┘└┘              └┘┘      │\n│                      │                                                 │\n│                      └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"step":"run","title":"op swaps the reference for the key as it starts the app","line":"op resolves the API_KEY reference; the app gets its value and PATH.","caption":"The agent passes the reference to run, and op resolves it as it starts the app: op’s environment holds the reference, the app’s holds the value. The agent’s request never contained the key, but the app can still print what it receives.","start":82.2,"end":97.967,"hold":85.7,"state":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true,"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"references","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"references","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#1"},{"step":"references","from":"T","to":"A","edge":"message:T->A#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]},"leaked":0,"argv":["op","run","--","app"],"childEnv":{"PATH":"/usr/bin","API_KEY":"secret-cloud-api"}},"changed":{"argv":{"after":["op","run","--","app"]},"childEnv":{"after":{"PATH":"/usr/bin","API_KEY":"secret-cloud-api"}}},"picture":"Code, 2 lines; Code “op's environment”, 2 lines; Code “app's environment”, 2 lines; An arrow from op’s environment to the app’s. Focused: 2: → op run -- app.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│       ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│       │ 2password run --env \"API_KEY=op://Personal/Cloud API/credential\" -- app       │\n│       ▌                                                                               │\n│       ▌ → op run -- app                                                               │\n│       └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────┐                ┌─────────────────────────┐\n│  │ op's environment                      │                │app's environment        │\n│  │                                       │                │                         │\n│  │ PATH=/usr/bin                         │───────────────▶│ PATH=/usr/bin           │\n│  │ API_KEY=op://Personal/Cloud API/credential             │ API_KEY=secret-cloud-api│\n│  └───────────────────────────────────────┘                └─────────────────────────┘\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"}]}]}